@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title AI Inference — select_action()

participant "Controller" as Ctrl
participant "AI Module\n(rnn_v1/model.py)" as AI
participant "GRUCardModel" as Model

Ctrl -> AI: select_action(state, hidden_state)

activate AI

== Step 1: Build input vector ==
AI -> AI: Build 14-d vector from state dict
note right
    Card counts: 4 floats (atk/def/heavy/counter)
    HP: AI HP + Human HP = 2 floats
    Last moves: AI one-hot(4) + Human one-hot(4) = 8 floats
    Round 1: both one-hot = [0,0,0,0]
    Total: 14 floats -> tensor (1, 14)
end note

== Step 2: Forward pass ==
AI -> Model: forward(input_tensor, hidden_tensor)
activate Model

Model -> Model: GRU(input) → gru_output (1, 8)
Model --> AI: policy_logits (1, 4)\nvalue (1, 1)\nnew_hidden (1, 8)

deactivate Model

== Step 3: Mask illegal actions ==
AI -> AI: For each card type c:\nif c not in AI hand → logit[c] = -inf

== Step 4: Select action ==
AI -> AI: probs = softmax(policy_logits)\naction_idx = argmax(probs)\ncard = ["attack","defense","heavy","counter"][action_idx]

== Step 5: Return ==
AI --> Ctrl: (card_string, new_hidden_as_list)

deactivate AI

@enduml
